  "ruleText": "He-W 639.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the granite workforce pilot program (GWPP) established in Laws 2018, 342:3-9.\n\nSource. #12713, INTERIM, eff 1-22-19, EXPIRES: 7-22-19",
